{"events":[{"idEvent":"2494000","idAPIfootball":"1557367","strTimestamp":"2026-08-21T19:00:00","strEvent":"Arsenal vs Coventry City","strEventAlternate":"Coventry City @ Arsenal","strFilename":"English Premier League 2026-08-21 Arsenal vs Coventry City","strSport":"Soccer","idLeague":"4328","strLeague":"English Premier League","strLeagueBadge":"https:\/\/r2.thesportsdb.com\/images\/media\/league\/badge\/gasy9d1737743125.png","strSeason":"2026-2027","strDescriptionEN":"Reigning champions Arsenal host newly promoted Championship winners Coventry City at Emirates Stadium to open the 2026–27 Premier League season.  The primary hurdle for Mikel Arteta's side is maintaining sharp rhythm and breaking down a low defensive block while dealing with the pressure of kicking off their title defense. The objective for the Gunners centers on controlling central midfield, using width through Bukayo Saka and Christos Tzolis to unpick the defense, and establishing early territorial dominance. Concurrently, the mission for Frank Lampard's Coventry City involves staying compact, absorbing early pressure, and creating counter-attacking opportunities through Ellis Simms and Brandon Thomas-Asante on their return to the top flight.","strHomeTeam":"Arsenal","strAwayTeam":"Coventry City","intHomeScore":"3","intHomeScoreExtra":null,"intAwayScoreExtra":null,"intRound":"1","intAwayScore":"0","intSpectators":null,"strOfficial":"","strWeather":"","dateEvent":"2026-08-21","dateEventLocal":"2026-08-21","strTime":"19:00:00","strTimeLocal":"20:00:00","strGroup":"","idHomeTeam":"133604","strHomeTeamBadge":"https:\/\/r2.thesportsdb.com\/images\/media\/team\/badge\/uyhbfe1612467038.png","idAwayTeam":"133625","strAwayTeamBadge":"https:\/\/r2.thesportsdb.com\/images\/media\/team\/badge\/uxyqys1424033798.png","intScore":null,"intScoreVotes":null,"strResult":"Arsenal kicked off their Premier League title defense with a comfortable 3–0 win over Coventry City at Emirates Stadium. Kai Havertz opened the scorin